WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Room to think.
Draw, calculate and explore. Your working stays with you.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Bring the idea into focus.
Review a sample transcription before insertion.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Write it as you would explain it.
Ordinary mathematical sentences, with the goal beside you.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
See exactly where it differs.
Compare what the goal needs with what the step establishes.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
One idea at a time.
Resolve the first draft goal; the next takes its place.

6
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Keep the whole argument.
A completed draft remains distinct from a kernel-checked proof.

7
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Go deeper, if you choose.
Optional syntax-highlighted generated source.

8
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
From working to a readable page.
Read and export with verification status intact.

9
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Stay at the board.
A quiet slate appearance, ready for the next idea.

